  "interpretation": "The chick dataset's colony-level num_breeding_pairs field cannot be treated as a hard biological denominator for a two-chick-slot null: more than one fifth of usable rows exceed two chicks per reported pair and the field rarely equals the November breeding-census count. Aggregating chick counts to island-season and using the independent November island breeding-pair total yields biologically coherent 0-2 chicks-per-pair values in all 124 usable island-seasons. Mechanism analysis should therefore move to island-level breeding success unless a validated colony-code/denominator crosswalk is obtained."
